<title>POLAND: KPW CLEARS BAUMA NEW ISSUE FOR TRADE.</title>
<headline>KPW CLEARS BAUMA NEW ISSUE FOR TRADE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission</p>
<p>(KPW) has cleared for public trade the new issue of construction</p>
<p>materials maker Bauma SA for two funds, the KPW said in a</p>
<p>statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The issue is to go to the Polish Private Equity Fund I</p>
<p>(PPEFI) and the Polish Private Equity Fund II (PPEFII), it said.</p>
<p> Tranches		  No Of Shares	   Subscription</p>
<p>			     Offered		  Period</p>
<p> PPEFI		     211,983		  July 21-25</p>
<p> PPEFII		    208,017		  July 21-25</p>
<p>EARNINGS DATA	    1996		   1995</p>
<p>(in mln of PLN)</p>
<p> Net profit:	     1.44		    0.42</p>
<p> Sales:		   13.66		   15.37</p>
<p>Main Shareholders:</p>
<p> Andrzej Kozlowski    - 24 pct of shares</p>
<p> Krzysztof Goetz	- 23.2 pct of shares</p>
<p> Zbigniew Kozminski   - 23.2 pct of shares</p>
<p>No of existing shares: 2,530,421.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
